<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>Monthly Account Review — <%= displayCustomer %> — <%= account %></title>
<style>
body{font:15px/1.5 Arial,sans-serif;max-width:900px;margin:30px auto;color:#1d2c41;padding:0 20px}
h1{color:#174a80;margin-bottom:0}h2{margin-top:28px;border-bottom:1px solid #dde7f0;padding-bottom:6px}
small,.muted{color:#687889} table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px}
td,th{padding:9px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e3eaf2;text-align:left}th.num,td.num{text-align:right}
.notice{padding:12px;background:#fff7e7;border-left:4px solid #daa84f}
.actions{display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:9px}
button{padding:10px 14px;background:#174a80;color:white;border:0;border-radius:7px;cursor:pointer}
@media print{.actions{display:none}body{margin:10px auto}}
</style>
<link rel="stylesheet" data-tk2m-blue-refresh href="<%= basePath %>/public/css/tk2m-blue-red-refresh.css">
</head><body>
<div class="actions"><button type="button" onclick="window.print()">Print / Save PDF</button></div>
<h1>Monthly Account Review</h1>
<h2 style="border:0;margin:5px 0 3px;color:#174a80"><%= displayCustomer %></h2>
<p class="muted">Account number: <strong><%= account %></strong></p>
<p class="muted"><strong><%= monthLabel(prior) %> compared with <%= monthLabel(month) %></strong></p>
<% if(crm?.status!=='linked'){ %><p class="notice"><strong>Management draft — CRM account confirmation pending.</strong>
 The customer's name is sourced from the uploaded supplier statement where available. Contract details must be confirmed before this report is sent.</p><% } %>
<p>Prepared as a customer communication draft. Nothing has been sent. All amounts are in South African rand (ZAR).</p>
<h2>Account billing summary</h2>
<table><tbody>
<tr><td><%= monthLabel(prior) %> invoice charges</td><td class="num">R<%= rand(comparison.previous.invoices) %></td></tr>
<tr><td><%= monthLabel(month) %> invoice charges</td><td class="num">R<%= rand(comparison.current.invoices) %></td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>Change in invoice charges</strong></td><td class="num"><strong><%= comparison.netChangeCents<0?'−':comparison.netChangeCents>0?'+':'' %>R<%= rand(Math.abs(comparison.netChangeCents)) %></strong></td></tr>
<tr><td>Current-month credit notes</td><td class="num">R<%= rand(comparison.current.credits) %></td></tr>
<tr><td>Current-month recorded payments</td><td class="num">R<%= rand(comparison.current.payments) %></td></tr>
<tr><td>Current month's charges after credits</td><td class="num">R<%= rand(comparison.current.netCharges) %></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
<p class="muted">Payment entries and prior balances are not invoice charges. The figures above do not independently establish the current amount outstanding.</p>
<h2>Largest account changes</h2>
<table><thead><tr><th>Billing reference</th><th class="num">Previously</th><th class="num">Current</th><th class="num">Change</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<% changes.forEach(function(c){ %><tr><td><%= c.reference %></td>
<td class="num">R<%= rand(c.oldCents) %></td><td class="num">R<%= rand(c.newCents) %></td>
<td class="num"><%= c.deltaCents>=0?'+':'−' %>R<%= rand(Math.abs(c.deltaCents)) %></td></tr>
<% }); %>
<% if(!changes.length){ %><tr><td colspan="4">No monetary changes have been identified for these periods.</td></tr><% } %>
</tbody></table>
<% if(comparison.categoryMatchedPending){ %><p class="notice">A recurring supplier invoice changed its reference number. Its total was compared by invoice category, but the underlying service still needs verification before external circulation.</p><% } %>
<h2>Explanations confirmed by Gerda</h2>
<% const verified=changes.filter(x=>x.review?.status==='verified'&&x.review?.reason); %>
<% if(verified.length){ %><ul>
<% verified.forEach(function(c){ %><li><strong><%= c.reference %>:</strong> <%= c.review.reason %></li><% }); %>
</ul><% } else { %><p class="notice">No explanations have been verified yet. Gerda can review each change in the Back Office and approve its explanation before sending this report.</p><% } %>
<% const pending=changes.filter(x=>x.review?.status!=='verified'); %>
<% if(pending.length){ %><p class="muted"><%= pending.length %> significant differences still need investigation. The reasons for these amounts are not yet confirmed.</p><% } %>
<h2>Services held in the CRM</h2>
<% if(crm?.status==='linked'){ %>
<p>The CRM currently records <strong><%= crm.lines.length %></strong> line entries on this account.
This is a current CRM snapshot, not necessarily the historical position at the billing date.</p>
<% if(crm.truncated){ %><p class="notice">The CRM line list exceeds 5,000 entries and is incomplete. Do not send this report as a complete account inventory.</p><% } %>
<% const active=crm.lines.filter(x=>x.line_status==='active'); %>
<p>Currently marked active: <strong><%= active.length %></strong>.</p>
<h2>Service and contract inventory</h2>
<p class="muted">The following entries reflect the CRM's current recorded information. A missing or provisional amount is not a verified supplier charge.</p>
<table><thead><tr><th>Line</th><th>Package</th><th>Status</th><th class="num">CRM monthly amount</th><th>Upgrade eligibility</th></tr></thead>
<tbody><% crm.lines.forEach(function(x){ %><tr>
<td><%= x.cell_number||'Not recorded' %></td>
<td><%= x.package_name||'Not recorded' %></td>
<td><%= x.line_status||'Unknown' %></td>
<td class="num"><%= x.monthly_invoice_amount==null?'Not recorded':'R'+Number(x.monthly_invoice_amount).toFixed(2) %></td>
<td><%= x.next_upgrade_date||'Not recorded' %></td>
</tr><% }); %></tbody></table>
<h2>Fixed and internet services recorded in the CRM</h2>
<% if(crm.fixedServices===null){ %>
<p class="notice">Fixed-service records could not be verified for this account; this draft is not a complete service inventory.</p>
<% }else{ %>
<p>Currently recorded fixed-service entries: <strong><%= crm.fixedServices.length %><%= crm.fixedTruncated?'+':'' %></strong>.</p>
<% if(crm.fixedTruncated){ %><p class="notice">This fixed-service listing is incomplete because it exceeds the supported review limit.</p><% } %>
<table><thead><tr><th>Solution / order</th><th>Site</th><th>Package</th><th>Status</th><th>Activation date</th></tr></thead>
<tbody><% crm.fixedServices.forEach(function(f){ %><tr>
<td><%= f.solution_id||f.order_number||'Not recorded' %></td>
<td><%= f.branch_name||f.service_title||'Not recorded' %></td>
<td><%= f.package_name||'Not recorded' %></td><td><%= f.service_status||'Unknown' %></td>
<td><%= f.activation_date||'Not recorded' %></td>
</tr><% }); %></tbody></table><% } %>
<h2>Coming up in the next four weeks</h2>
<% const currentDate=new Date();const end=new Date(currentDate.getTime()+28*86400000);
 const upcoming=crm.lines.filter(x=>x.next_upgrade_date&&new Date(x.next_upgrade_date+'T12:00:00Z')>=currentDate&&new Date(x.next_upgrade_date+'T12:00:00Z')<=end); %>
<% if(upcoming.length){ %><p><strong><%= upcoming.length %></strong> currently recorded upgrade eligibility dates fall within the next 28 days.</p>
<ul><% upcoming.slice(0,25).forEach(function(x){ %><li><%= x.cell_number||'Service line' %> — <%= x.next_upgrade_date %> (eligibility, not a confirmed upgrade)</li><% }); %></ul>
<% } else { %><p>No dated upgrade eligibilities in this four-week window were found in the current CRM line records.</p><% } %>
<% } else { %>
<p class="notice">The supplier statement has not yet been confirmed against its exact TK2M CRM customer record. Gerda can confirm the account match in the Back Office. Until then, CRM service and contract details are excluded.</p>
<% } %>
<h2>CRM service activity and planned follow-ups</h2>
<p class="muted">The following figures are drawn from internally recorded CRM events and scheduled work, not from supplier billing evidence. Gerda must verify their meaning before promising any completed or future service change.</p>
<% if(activity?.events==null){ %><p>Monthly CRM change-event records could not be verified.</p>
<% }else{ %><p>CRM events recorded during <%= month %>: <strong><%= activity.events.length %><%= activity.events.length>=200?' (at least)':'' %></strong>. These may include import records and require confirmation before describing them as completed transactions.</p><% } %>
<% if(activity?.upcomingTasks==null){ %><p>Pending follow-up work could not be verified.</p>
<% }else{ %><p>Outstanding internal follow-ups scheduled for the next four weeks: <strong><%= activity.upcomingTasks.length %><%= activity.upcomingTasks.length>=100?' (at least)':'' %></strong>. A scheduled task is not necessarily an approved upgrade or confirmed activation.</p><% } %>
<h2>Review and next steps</h2>
<p>Changes without an approved explanation should be investigated against the detailed supplier invoice and relevant CRM change records. Scheduled future actions are not completed transactions.</p>
<p class="muted">Draft generated <%= generatedAt %>. Nothing has been sent. Verify the customer, recipient, and every explanation before emailing a copy.</p>
</body></html>
